{"description":"Participant channel that also names the evidence timeline, the accepted mandate processor key and the evidence profile for operations decided by evidence. The three added fields are fixed for the life of the document. Implementation requires this exact protocol.","evidenceProfile":{"description":"Published evidence profile under which evidence for this channel is checked. Its exact type must be a supported specialisation of Evidence Profile, defined by the profile's package; it selects the native support a host must implement. This schema does not enforce the exact type; the processor does.","schema":{"required":true},"type":"Coordination/Evidence Profile"},"evidenceTimeline":{"description":"Evidence timeline of this channel, at the provider of the channel's timeline. It is not an input source of the document.","schema":{"required":true},"type":"Coordination/Signed Timeline"},"mandateProcessorKey":{"description":"Public key whose signature on a private authority state this participant accepts: 64 characters 0-9a-f.","schema":{"required":true},"type":"Coordination/Ed25519 Public Key"},"name":"Timeline Channel with Evidence","specification":{"blueId":"9MdKsAApwjLjFXTw75necZ5XPuY4o5M7SX2bF5zNrwij"},"type":"Coordination/Timeline Channel"}
